16-  - The top-down map (`#2a`) is a flow prototype. Its pixel values are the rules for behaviour: ratios, rates, orders and trigger conditions. They are not a coordinate system. Convert them into world metres around the existing jungle layout (`jungle.ts`: `CLIFF`, `CAVE`, `POOL`, `STAGE`, spawn at origin). Do not copy the Lookdev coordinates such as `LANTERN_POST=(2.3,0,4.2)`, the 90×90 ground slice or its `pathX` height formula.
17-  - Do not ship the following prototype-only UI: the Lookdev start screen, the `Grafik/Auto/Niedrig/Mittel/Hoch` buttons, the "Im Blick" view panel, the "Was passiert" event log or the map legend. Quality already lives in the settings dialog. Only the in-world prompts (`E <prompt>`) and a short HUD state line ship.
18-  - Tier detection and the 3 s / 24 ms step-down already exist in `src/app/engine/capability.service.ts`. Do not rewrite them. Per-tier counts for plants, canopy and fireflies belong to the jungle, keyed on the existing `QualityTier`.
19-  - Do not change the camera defaults: FOV, boom and far plane stay as they are.
20-- No new runtime dependencies. The initial bundle stays within the `scripts/check-budget.mjs` budget.
