105-#### Ground
106-
107-- Plane `90×90`, segments `180×180`, shifted `z=-12`.
108-- `pathX(z)=sin(z*.09)*1.6`.
109-- Smooth path height range `1.4..3.6`.
110-- Base height `.35*sin(x*.21)*cos(z*.17)+.18*sin(x*.53+z*.31)+.08*sin(x*1.3-z*1.1)`.
111-- Outside `abs(x)>11`, add `pow(max(0,abs(x)-11),1.4)*.18`.
112-- Below `z<-33`, add `pow(max(0,-z-33),1.2)*.4`.
113-- Colours moss `0x3b5a2f`, soil `0x4a3f2a`, dark `0x26361f`.
114-- Keep indexed geometry; call `computeVertexNormals()`; sample `colorAt` per vertex. Do not restore current `toNonIndexed()` / per-face triangle colours; this fixes SwiftShader faceting.
115-- Noise shader: wet detail absent for `detail<.5`; otherwise `smoothstep(.6,.72,.65*vnoise(p*.3)+.35*vnoise(p*1.25))`. For `detail>.5`, diffuse `.82+.36*vnoise(vWP*3.7)`. For `detail>1.5`, litter `smoothstep(.78,.84,vnoise(vWP*8.5))`, mix `vec3(.30,.21,.10)` at `.6*(1-wet)`. Wet darkens `mix(1,.55)`, roughness `.08`; dapple detail `>.5`.
